!! cmavo: gei (VUhU2)

!!! Current definition

exponential notation -- trinary mathematical operator: order of magnitude/value/base; [b * (c to the a power)] --

!!! Proposed definition
scientific notation: x_2 * (x_3 ~94~ x_1); x_2 defaults to 1; x_3 defaults to 10

!!! Proposed keyword

* scientific notation

!!! Examples of ''gei'' Usage

;li cinonoki'oki'o du li bi gei ci:300,000,000 = 3 * 10~94~8 (CLL, §18.14, example 14.2)

;gei reno:10~94~20 (CLL, §18.14, example 14.3)

;papano bi'eju'u re gei pipanopano bi'eju'u re ge'a re:.1010_2 * 2 ~94~ 110_2 (CLL, §18.14, example 14.4)

